{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1141991-1e-how-does-harvest-pledges-merit-work","id":1141991,"title":"1E How does Harvest (Pledges) merit work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-19T19:04:26-07:00","id":1141991,"title":"1E How does Harvest (Pledges) merit work?","content":"Reading the other day the Corebook from 1st edition Changeling the lost i stumbled on this problem.<br /> <br /> How Harvest (Pledge) merit works?<br /> <br /> On the book says<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Core Lost, page 94;</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Each dot of Harvest adds one die to certain rolls related to gathering Glamour.<br /> A character must specify what type of Glamour-gathering activities this Merit represents when it is purchased. The different types available include but are not necessarily limited to Emotions, Pledges, Dreams and Hedge Bounty.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems straight forward enough, a bonus dice to the rolls, however unlike the rest of the harvesting methods, pledges dont have a roll. It all depends on the agreement being made.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Core Lost, page 90;</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pledges: Fulfilling obligations sworn with the weight of the Wyrd is another way that changelings commonly obtain Glamour; the exact amount of Glamour gained and the circumstances required to generate it depend on the specifics of the pledge in question. For more on the creation of pledges that bestow Glamour as a boon, see \u201cPledges,\u201d p. 181.</div> </div> </div> </div>So how then Harvest (Pledge) works if there is no dicepool to boost? Does it means that if my character with &quot;Harvest (Pledge): 5&quot; makes a pledge to receive 1 glamour per month he would receive 6 glamour instead (or the maximum depending on both parties wyrd score)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T20:05:27-07:00","id":1142796,"title":"","content":"They never to my knowledge explained that. <br /> <br /> I'd personally just give 1 extra glamour per dot for each Glamour Pledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}